**Context worth noting:** the Budget is not the latest full-year view. The **LF1 Reforecast (Mar-26)** puts FY26 operating profit at **7,103**, i.e. 533 favourable to Budget {[S1]}, on revenue of 281,316 vs Budget 279,294 {[S25]}. If you want the current expectation rather than the Budget benchmark, use the LF1 number.

